    finding "AA3" state="open" size="frame-sized" \
        text="promoted-truth-is-derived runs in BOTH directions, so a capability that should have \
            moved and did not is refused exactly like one that moved too far. The consequence: after \
            a cut, `praxis check` FAILS until promotion runs" \
        note="that was not designed, it fell out of writing the rule as an equality rather than as a \
